          "id": 1283571012,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The RDMnet over TCP heuristic dissector has to be enabled to check this - those heuristics are disabled by default, but probably could be enabled, they check a 12 byte string so presumably false positives are close to non-existent.\n\n@chuckcraft, I think you asked for a sample pcap of this a while back.",
